null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:02:24Z", "username": "Kintu", "text": "Yeah the first episode. Not sure if it is 0 or 1. Will have to check", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:03:01Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "About the question, I think you can cut down on the biblical story part a little", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:03:10Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "I'll do the hashtag thing when starting a quiz. Sorry I always forget to do that", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:03:10Z", "username": "Kintu", "text": "IKRRRRRR I watched it the 5th time recently (Rewatching the whole show lol) and thought yeh to mast Quiz question ho sakta hai", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:03:28Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "But good hints directing to answer with red herrings", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:03:47Z", "username": "Kintu", "text": "I also got another idea for a Q from that episode. Framing it now, will send it soon", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:04:20Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Na its ok, dont need hashtag per se but it helps. What helps a looot more is as complete Qs as possible (means we can catch it in the initial analysis and not spend on tokens) + explicit confirmations (saves the work of the llm having to analyze the context for answers)", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:04:29Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Imho, you don't need to overthink this. Just ask the Qs/do the set. If you falter, you can always improve. I'm speaking from experience coz I've also asked some bad Qs here. It's fine", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:04:54Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "No one is going to judge you here for that", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:05:13Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "I think he’s asking for his live quiz that he’s doing", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:05:22Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Ohh okay. My bad then", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:06:04Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "What exactly do you mean by \"explicit confirmations\"?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:06:46Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "“Answer” is correct", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:07:22Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "For example for this question, it would be helpful if you say\n‘Medusa is correct’\n‘Correct’\n‘Medusa it is’ etc", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:07:27Z", "username": "Kintu", "text": "Yeah all these Q making inspired me and now I host monthly quizzing for my friends. I make some questions and if I dont get time then I will borrow a few from here with due credits haha. The thing is my friends are not quizzers so I wanted to make sure the hints are out in the clear and its crackable", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:07:42Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Instead of using emojis which aren't detected in think.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:07:51Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "What is in Blue? ‎<attached: 00138630-PHOTO-2026-04-30-20-07-51.jpg>", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:07:54Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Yess", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:07:55Z", "username": "Aditi Bapat", "text": "It was about studying the effects of Janus Kinase inhibitors used in solid tumors, on cells other than the cancer cells.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:08:01Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Achha okay", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:08:10Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Oh so the tick isn't enough?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:08:14Z", "username": "Aditi Bapat", "text": "Lot of molecular biology, immunology, mouse models, the works", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:08:21Z", "username": "Smit D Mahajani", "text": "Achha okay. I'll write it explicitly", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:08:37Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Unfortunately whatsapp doesnt export emojis, thats the most frustrating aspect", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:08:56Z", "username": "Saumay", "text": "Sounds interesting. Can we watch this episode in isolation or do we need to watch the entire show?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-05-01T03:09:06Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Watch the show bro", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null},